    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pandĭcŭlor</span></b> ,
			āri, v. dep.
		2. pando, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to stretch one's self</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut pandiculans oscitatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 5, 2, 80</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pandiculari dicuntur, qui toto corpore
					oscitantes extenduntur, eo quod pandi fiunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 220</span></i>
			 Müll.</div>
